# Important Finding I8: neither Dockerfile nor admin_ui/Dockerfile COPY
# these paths (Dockerfile only COPYs app/ and scripts/; admin_ui/Dockerfile
# only COPYs admin_ui/app.py), so without this file the entire repo --
# including the 6.3GB .venv, runtime data/, and full .git history -- was
# sent to the Docker daemon as build context on every `docker compose
# build`, a real contributor to a prior ~29-minute build.
.venv
data
.git
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.superpowers
tests
docs
